   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Reporting faults",
     "texto": [
      "To describe problems at home, specific verbs and adjectives are used: «De kraan lekt» (the tap drips), «De verwarming is kapot» (the heating is broken). To indicate when the problem started, «sinds» is used: «sinds vanochtend» (since this morning). «Laten weten» is a key construction that means to notify or to let someone know."
     ],
